; source: project import/include regression fixture
; behavior: two sibling imports of the same well-known module under
; different aliases.  Imports are weak, scope-bound references, so the
; two imports produce two independent, non-conflicting subtrees
; (`first.COSE_Key` and `second.COSE_Key`).  They must not be rejected
; as a cycle just because the well-known name is the same.

;# import rfc9052 as first

;# import rfc9052 as second

first_cose_key_ref = first.COSE_Key
second_cose_key_ref = second.COSE_Key
